OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening with just a few
OL,7,Fshowers. A band of more frequent and
OL,8,Fheavier showers pushes south into
OL,9,FShetland overnight, and reaching
OL,10,FOrkney around morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRather cloudy in the morning
OL,13,Fwith scattered showers, heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Some brighter spells developing
OL,15,Flater, but with a chilly freshening
OL,16,Fnortherly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
